 decide (v = j)) * direct.2)\n","truth_boundary":"One Level B author-derived positive finite-batch canonical compiler and its associated private concrete Appendix B.1 operational consumers only. Actual raw reversed request/reply history, source state/Option readback and actual query counts are retained. Separate own FO/gradient policies use genuine internal reply/gradient reconstruction for every full Os at3≤n≤d,κ≥4,k=d/n,m=2k,2fuel<n. Exact total/per-block costs and ordinary real L1 expectation identities; stops and none exhaustion remain explicit. No universal source Alg/Q_G representation, Haar/posterior/padded Eq13 law, guaranteed successful sampler, finite precision/noisy/TV/runtime theorem, C6/L44/either main bound, main/global-site integration, purification or Goal closure. Actual math480/native witness does not mean later metadata/public trees were Lean rebuilt."},"exact_original_row":{"bytes":15794,"file":".astis/huanjian-gc-batched-oracle-simulation-20261116/metadata-drafts/normal-PL-preparation-v2-latest-main/normal-PL-execution.actual/own-evidence-candidate/actual-PROVED_LOCAL-append.exact.jsonl","sha256":"9cf7b83274450d4a5647e206fe1961969da3d75b745615f8a832f246005cb540"},"original_API_receipt":{"bytes":1528,"file":".astis/huanjian-gc-batched-oracle-simulation-20261116/metadata-drafts/normal-PL-preparation-v2-latest-main/normal-PL-execution.actual/actual-OS-process.receipt.json","sha256":"0e0a7a0ff5b60461bcdbe992fac9e28824a9a4ffb5ec7565fe036e0dee97dacf"},"original_worker_id":"huanjian_20261116_batched_oracle_simulation","preserved_exact_ledger_prefix":true},"publication_declarations":["AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Analysis.BatchedOracleSimulation.batch_simulation_with_trace_and_label_costs"],"reader_acceptance":{"actual_checks":2516,"actual_failures":0,"independent_acceptance_original":{"bytes":371131,"file":"research-wiki/technical-lemmas/batched-oracle-simulation-semantic-evidence/reader-current-originals/actual-reader-acceptance.json","sha256":"